  "instructions": [
    "Wrap the pandan-leaf wrap in a dry towel and heat in a microwave for 30 seconds.",
    "Spread the passata evenly over the center of the wrapped leaf.",
    "Top the passata with ferment-kimchi, chopped cilantro, scallions, red pepper flakes, minced garlic, and a drizzle of olive oil.",
    "Season with salt to taste.",
    "Fold the bottom edge of the wrap up over the filling, then fold in the sides and roll up the wrap.",
    "Repeat with the remaining ingredients.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy."
